  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "html": "两种\"随机\"，用途完全不同"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>random</code> 是<strong>伪随机</strong>：给定种子，序列完全可复现。这对测试是优点，对密码是灾难。安全场景一律用 <code>secrets</code>，这条线划清了两者边界。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "<code>random</code>：可复现，可测试"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c1",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "import random\n\nrandom.seed(42)\nprint(random.randint(1, 10))\nprint(random.choice([\"a\", \"b\", \"c\"]))\nprint(round(random.random(), 4))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "2\na\n0.7416"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>seed(42)</code> 之后，三个调用的结果<strong>永远一样</strong>。测试里需要\"随机但可复现\"的数据就靠这个：种子固定，断言才能写死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "不设种子时，默认从系统熵源取种——每次运行都不同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "<code>shuffle</code> 与 <code>sample</code>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c2",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "import random\n\nrandom.seed(7)\ndeck = list(range(5))\nrandom.shuffle(deck)\nprint(deck)\n\nprint(random.sample(deck, 2))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "[4, 0, 3, 1, 2]\n[4, 2]"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>shuffle</code> 原地打乱；<code>sample</code> 无放回抽样，不会重复取同一个元素。抽卡、抽奖名单用 <code>sample</code> 而不是循环 <code>choice</code>。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "<code>secrets</code>：安全随机"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c3",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "import secrets\n\ntoken = secrets.token_hex(16)\nprint(len(token))\nprint(secrets.compare_digest(token, token))",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "32\nTrue"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<code>token_hex(16)</code> 生成 32 个十六进制字符（16 字节熵）。<code>compare_digest</code> 做<strong>常数时间比较</strong>，防止通过比较耗时推断内容——校验令牌用它，别用 <code>==</code>。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "哈希：不可逆的指纹"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "id": "c4",
      "lang": "python",
      "code": "import hashlib\n\nh = hashlib.sha256(b\"abc\")\nprint(h.hexdigest()[:16])\nprint(h.digest_size)",
      "runnable": true,
      "editable": true,
      "expect": "ba7816bf8f01cfea\n32"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "输入差一个字节，输出完全不同；无法从哈希反推输入。密码存储用 <code>hashlib.pbkdf2_hmac</code> 加盐迭代，<strong>绝不存明文</strong>，也别用普通 <code>sha256</code> 存密码（没有盐，可被彩虹表破解）。"
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "kind": "warn",
      "title": "什么时候用哪个",
      "html": "测试造数据、随机抽样、洗牌 → <code>random</code>；令牌、密钥、密码重置链接 → <code>secrets</code>；指纹、文件校验 → <code>hashlib</code>；全局唯一 ID → <code>uuid.uuid4()</code>。选错的前一个字节就是安全事故。"
    },
    {
      "type": "quiz",
      "question": "生成用户密码重置链接里的随机令牌，应该用哪个？",
      "options": [
        "random.random()",
        "random.seed(时间戳) 后取值",
        "secrets.token_urlsafe(32)",
        "hashlib.md5(用户名).hexdigest()"
      ],
      "answer": 2,
      "explain": "重置令牌必须不可预测：random 是可复现的伪随机（知道种子就能推算），md5 可被穷举。secrets 从操作系统熵源取数，专门为安全用途设计。"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "html": "小结"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "<code>random</code> 伪随机可复现（<code>seed</code> 固定），适合测试与模拟。",
        "<code>shuffle</code> 原地打乱，<code>sample</code> 无放回抽样。",
        "安全令牌、密钥一律 <code>secrets</code>，比较用 <code>compare_digest</code>。",
        "密码存储用 <code>pbkdf2_hmac</code> 加盐，指纹校验用 <code>sha256</code>。"
      ]
    }
  ],
